%% Status: built (phase 1). CaptureViewModel.captureAndCheckPhoto + shared checkPhotoQuality.
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as CaptureScreen
    participant VM as CaptureViewModel
    participant F as shared CaptureFlow
    participant C as CameraSession (CameraX)
    participant Q as shared checkPhotoQuality

    S->>VM: READY reached
    VM->>F: startCapture()
    F-->>VM: true, state = CheckingPhoto
    VM->>C: takePhoto() (CAPTURE_MODE_MAXIMIZE_QUALITY)
    alt capture error
        C-->>VM: ImageCaptureException
        VM->>F: onCaptureFailed()
    else photo taken
        C-->>VM: ImageProxy (full resolution)
        Note over VM: Dispatchers.Default (off main)
        VM->>VM: cropToTargetFrame (full res)<br/>scaledToLongSide(640)<br/>toPixelImage()
        VM->>F: checkPhoto(PixelImage)
        F->>Q: cheapest checks first
        Q-->>F: null or NO_SAMPLE / TOO_DARK / GLARE / BLURRY
        VM->>F: onPhotoChecked(rejection)
    end
    F-->>VM: PhotoAccepted / PhotoRejected(reason) / CaptureFailed
    VM-->>S: uiState
    S->>VM: retake()
    VM->>F: retake(): back to Guiding
